---
import Site from "../../layouts/Site.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
const link = (p: string) => `${base}${p}`;

const founders = [
  {
    name: "Chien-Fu Chen",
    role: "CEO & Co-Founder",
    bio: "Wrote the first lines of code in 2014 and has architected the platform ever since. Every module of the operating system was built under his technical direction. Twelve years building in-house, zero reliance on third-party core infrastructure.",
  },
  {
    name: "Joaquín Jadue",
    role: "CFO & Co-Founder",
    bio: "Built the financial discipline and operating structure that brought the company to PCAOB-level public company standards. Bootstrapped without institutional equity for twelve years. EBITDA margin expanded from 34% to 44.6% under his financial architecture.",
  },
  {
    name: "Yethro Dinamarca",
    role: "Chairman",
    bio: "Long-term strategy, governance and the transition from regional platform to public company. Joined eight years ago to build the financial architecture and the path to capital markets. Architected the path from Chile to Nasdaq.",
  },
];
---
<Site title="Leadership & Alignment · Ticketplus" current="leadership">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header__inner">
      <p class="page-header__eyebrow">Leadership &amp; alignment</p>
      <h1 class="page-header__title">Three founders. <span class="accent">Twelve years.</span></h1>
      <p class="page-header__lead">Bootstrapped, profitable, aligned with shareholders through long-term equity. 100% ownership pre-IPO held by founders, Chairman and key employees.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="leadership">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">Operators, not promoters</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">The team behind the platform.</h2>

      <div class="ldr-grid">
        {founders.map((f) => (
          <article class="ldr-card">
            <div class="ldr-card__front">
              <div class="ldr-card__photo"></div>
              <h3 class="ldr-card__name">{f.name}</h3>
              <p class="ldr-card__role">{f.role}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ldr-card__back">
              <h3 class="ldr-card__name ldr-card__name--inv">{f.name}</h3>
              <p class="ldr-card__role ldr-card__role--inv">{f.role}</p>
              <p class="ldr-card__bio">{f.bio}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="founders-letter">
        <div class="founders-letter__header">
          <span class="founders-letter__label">A letter from the founders</span>
          <h3 class="founders-letter__title">From Chile to Nasdaq.<br/>Twelve years and counting.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="founders-letter__body">
          <p>Twelve years ago, two longtime friends from Chile wrote the first lines of code for what is now Ticketplus. Eight years ago, our Chairman joined to build the financial architecture and the path to capital markets. Today we serve 11 countries, 2,800 partners, 39,800 events per year and 10.2 million tickets processed annually — profitably, with our own technology built in-house.</p>
          <p>Before Ticketplus, our team had spent years building software products across industries. When live entertainment came knocking, we applied the same DNA: product strategy, operational thinking, and technology built in-house. Ticketplus was never an accident. It was muscle memory.</p>
          <p><strong>Nasdaq is not the goal. It is the vehicle.</strong> It is the table where leading Latin American technology platforms already sit. And now it is Chile's turn.</p>
          <p>The next ten years will not be about ticketing. They will be about becoming the operating system for live experiences across Latin America, and then beyond. The platform is the company. The vertical is the wedge. The horizon is open.</p>
          <p>We are aligned with our shareholders through long-term equity ownership. Pre-IPO ownership remains 100% with founders, Chairman and key employees. Our bet is the long-term value of what we build together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="founders-letter__sign">
          <span>Chien-Fu Chen</span>
          <span>Joaquín Jadue</span>
          <span>Yethro Dinamarca</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="pagenav">
    <div class="container pagenav__inner">
      <a class="pagenav__side" href={link("/about/")}>
        <span class="pagenav__label">← Previous</span>
        <span class="pagenav__title">About Ticketplus</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pagenav__side pagenav__side--next" href={link("/ipo/")}>
        <span class="pagenav__label">Next →</span>
        <span class="pagenav__title">IPO process</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</Site>

<style>
  .ldr-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 48px 0 40px;
  }

  .ldr-card {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: default;
    min-height: 380px;
  }

  /* FRONT */
  .ldr-card__front {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--color-surface-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 40px 32px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ldr-card:hover .ldr-card__front {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-8px);
  }

  /* Gray photo placeholder */
  .ldr-card__photo {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-gray-200);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ldr-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .ldr-card__name--inv { color: #ffffff; }

  .ldr-card__role {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ldr-card__role--inv { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

  /* BACK */
  .ldr-card__back {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: #000;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 40px 32px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ldr-card:hover .ldr-card__back {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ldr-card__bio {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .ldr-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ldr-card { min-height: 320px; }
  }

  /* Founders letter */
  .founders-letter {
    margin-top: 64px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .founders-letter__header {
    padding: 48px 56px 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .founders-letter__label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .founders-letter__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .founders-letter__body {
    padding: 40px 56px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .founders-letter__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .founders-letter__body strong {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .founders-letter__sign {
    padding: 28px 56px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .founders-letter__sign span {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .founders-letter__header,
    .founders-letter__body,
    .founders-letter__sign { padding-left: 28px; padding-right: 28px; }
  }
</style>
